<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-PAKISTAN 378 ALL OUT IN 1ST INNINGS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-PAKISTAN 378 ALL OUT IN 1ST INNINGS.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan were all out for 378 in their first innings shortly after play started on the fourth day of the first test against Sri Lanka in Colombo on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scores: Sri Lanka 330, Pakistan 378</p>
</text>
